    "remedy_1": {
      "id": "remedy_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's repair this one.\n\nA common DS mistake is mentally carrying information from I into the test of II alone. Reset between statements.\n\nI alone gives only cost; II alone gives only sale. Together: profit 100 on 500 = 20%, so both are required.\n\nNow use the same idea with fresh values.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
